&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Venn&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venn is the sovereign AI platform for real estate. We turn each company’s data, knowledge and way of operating into its own Company Brain, then build bespoke applications and AI agents on top of it to grow revenue, reduce costs and improve performance. The intelligence stays the customer’s proprietary asset and compounds over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 270 owners and operators run on Venn across 30 states and five countries. Our customers include Related, Bozzuto and Kairoi Residential in the U.S. and Grand City Properties in Europe. Our platform is approaching one million homes, and our contracted revenue has more than quadrupled in the past year. Venn has raised over $140 million from investors including Group 11 and NOA, and recently acquired a16z-backed Zuma to accelerate our AI agents.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to make sure AI sharpens what makes a real estate company different, instead of erasing it. Come build it with us&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Venn partners with a leading German residential property company that manages a large portfolio across the country. As our Senior Technical Customer Success Manager in Berlin, you will own this strategic relationship end to end, from onboarding and implementation through long-term adoption. You are hands-on and technical: you understand the client&#39;s business and systems, and you build the automations, implementation tools and training that make the rollout succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the client&#39;s primary point of contact and their voice inside Venn, working closely with our Product, Engineering, Support and Data teams. You work independently, see the big picture, and drive results without waiting for direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After 12 months, success means the rollout phases are live on schedule, adoption targets are met across the client&#39;s teams, and the client sees Venn as a trusted long-term partner. [REVIEW: confirm the 12-month success measures] As Venn grows in Germany, you will have room to help build the customer success function here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the client relationship end to end, as the primary point of contact for stakeholders from property managers to leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead onboarding and implementation on the client side together with Venn&#39;s Product and Engineering teams: timelines, stakeholders, configuration, integrations and go-lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automations, implementation tools and processes that make onboarding faster and repeatable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver training programs and materials, building the client&#39;s self-sufficiency on the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption across a large, distributed portfolio, including property management, customer service and back-office teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the client&#39;s priorities and systems, and translate them into clear, prioritized requirements for Venn&#39;s Product team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate technical issues with the client and work with Venn&#39;s Support and Engineering teams to resolve them [REVIEW: align with Eli on what Support covers (language, hours, location) and adjust this line]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on user engagement and value against agreed KPIs, including regular business reviews and steering meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate German-specific requirements and stakeholders, such as data protection (GDPR) and works council processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share German market and localization insights to help shape Venn&#39;s product for Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Requirements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in customer-facing roles in B2B SaaS, such as Customer Success, Technical CSM, Implementation or Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical background: hands-on with integrations, APIs, data and automation or no-code tools, and comfortable troubleshooting technical issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record leading enterprise software implementations with multiple stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent German and English (C1 or higher), written and verbal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent self-starter who takes ownership, sees the big picture and engages confidently with senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel regularly, within Germany and to Venn&#39;s offices abroad&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Berlin and eligible to work in Germany [REVIEW (HR / Deel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in German residential real estate (Wohnungswirtschaft, Hausverwaltung) or with software for the property sector&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proptech, startup or scale-up experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with ERP environments such as SAP, and with CRM, support and project management tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building customer success processes or playbooks from scratch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with international teams across time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ace-line&quot; data-node-type=&quot;line&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT IS BOX?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box (NYSE:BOX) is the leader in Intelligent Content Management. Our platform enables organizations to fuel collaboration, manage the entire content lifecycle, secure critical content, and transform business workflows with enterprise AI. We help companies thrive in the new AI-first era of business. Founded in 2005, Box simplifies work for leading global organizations, including JLL, Morgan Stanley, and Nationwide. Box is headquartered in Redwood City, CA, with offices across the United States, Europe, and Asia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By joining Box, you will have the unique opportunity to continue driving our platform forward. Content powers how we work. It’s the billions of files and information flowing across teams, departments, and key business processes every single day: contracts, invoices, employee records, financials, product specs, marketing assets, and more. Our mission is to bring intelligence to the world of content management and empower our customers to completely transform workflows across their organizations. With the combination of AI and enterprise content, the opportunity has never been greater to transform how the world works together and at Box you will be on the front lines of this massive shift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY BOX NEEDS YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a dynamic team of consultants and technologists who are dedicated to making our customers successful, but our customers&#39; needs are getting even more sophisticated and technically complex.&amp;nbsp; We are looking to add more consultative muscle to the Implementation Consulting team in order to solve our customers&#39; most complex challenges through the application of thought leadership and technical domain expertise.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box is growing fast. Real fast. Every business in the world is looking to modernize the way that they work. As the leader in cloud content management, Box has what it takes to enable enterprises to transform how people work together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively engage directly with large and complex enterprises to help transform their business using Box technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will act as a customer advocate, motivated by helping others succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will listen actively, ask questions, and translate business needs into actionable plans.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building trusting relationships and provide advice on improving strategies for long-term success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will serve as a liaison between multiple teams with competing priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will possess persuasive, professional, flexible, and detail-oriented skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be ready to join a strong team that influences the company&#39;s long-term success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be comfortable in this role as you contribute to the team&#39;s efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an AI-first company. This means you approach your work with a growth mindset and find ways to leverage AI to help make faster, smarter decisions that will 10X your impact at Box.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have 7+ years in software implementation or Consulting.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have at least 2+ years in SaaS industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have led multiple complex projects or initiatives at once while still being laser-focused on detail.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an excellent multi-tasker and thrive in a fast-paced, ever-changing environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are experienced in customer-facing presentations and have a consistent record of working with senior leaders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box lives its values, with community and in-person collaboration being a core part of our culture. Boxers are expected to work from their assigned office a minimum of 3 days per week. Your Recruiter will share more about how we work and company culture during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based on current business needs, there is no relocation assistance provided for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Box, we believe unique and diverse experiences benefit our culture, our products, our customers, our company, and our world. We aim to recruit a passionate, high-performing workforce that reflects the world we live in.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;If you are head-over-heels about this role but unsure if you meet all the requirements, we encourage you to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BENEFITS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Box Benefits package includes 30 days of vacation, medical, and dental coverage. We have a robust wellness program including 30 days of vacation (plus your birthday off!) and subsidized gym membership. Boxers can also participate in our Employee Stock Purchase plan and other additional perks and benefits. Germany&#39;s office is based in a WeWork (Neuturmstrasse 5, Munich, BY 80331,) as well as other European offices across London, Paris, Amsterdam, and Warsaw.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, disability, and any other protected ground of discrimination under applicable human rights legislation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For details on how we protect your information when you apply, please see our &lt;a href=&quot;https://cloud.app.box.com/s/dalfrm4h1m5wkjiq6171hbko9uwroulg&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-d0f4f175-3786-4719-8525-e15da4281b97&quot;&gt;Personnel Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NOTICE OF USE OF AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;bullet_list&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;list_item&amp;quot;,null]&quot;&gt;At Box, we believe in the power of AI to improve the recruiting process while keeping people at the heart of every decision. For more information on the use of AI in our hiring process, please visit our webpage &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.box.com/en/how-we-hire/ai-in-our-hiring-process/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-attrib-id=&quot;link-b6d5ae6d-3111-427e-8883-655af5f92bce&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT ROCKET LAB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rocket Lab is the end-to-end space company building rockets, spacecraft, and critical subsystems that keep the world connected, protected, expand humanity’s reach to the Moon, Mars, and beyond. We move fast, build real hardware for meaningful missions, and make the impossible routine. Come shape the future with us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIRECTOR – EUROPEAN GOVERNMENT OPERATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Director – European Government Operations, based in &lt;strong&gt;Munich/ Berlin, &lt;/strong&gt;Germany, you will lead Rocket Lab’s government affairs strategy across Germany and the broader European region. You will play a critical role in advancing Rocket Lab’s business objectives by shaping policy environments, building strategic government relationships, and ensuring alignment between Government Affairs and Business Development. In this role, you will work at the intersection of aerospace innovation, national security, and European public-sector engagement. To be successful, you must be results‑oriented, proactive, politically astute, and deeply comfortable operating in complex, fast‑moving environments. Join a driven team of pioneers relentlessly tackling challenging projects, delivering on the impossible, and making an impact on the future of space.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL GET TO DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead Rocket Lab’s in‑house European Government Operations function, delivering the same level of strategic support and government engagement the company receives in the U.S. market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and lead Rocket Lab’s government affairs strategy in Germany and across Europe, ensuring alignment with corporate priorities and business development objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain high‑impact relationships with key German federal stakeholders, including the Bundestag, DLR, Ministry of Defense, and relevant regulatory and executive agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and grow Rocket Lab’s presence with government entities and innovation ecosystems in Munich and other strategic European hubs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Business Development team to support market expansion, customer engagement, and pursuit of government‑funded programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and influence policy discussions related to space, defense, launch, and emerging technologies, ensuring Rocket Lab’s interests are represented and understood&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic guidance on political, regulatory, and industrial‑policy developments across Europe, identifying opportunities and risks for business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Rocket Lab in industry associations, working groups, and public‑sector forums to strengthen the company’s visibility and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable business outcomes through targeted government engagement not only monitoring policy trends but actively shaping them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to senior leadership on European political dynamics, defense priorities, and government procurement pathways&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOU’LL BRING THESE QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in political science, international relations, public policy, law, economics, engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of experience in government affairs, public policy, defense, aerospace, or related strategic roles within Germany or Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success building and managing relationships with senior government officials, policymakers, and public‑sector institutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to drive business‑aligned outcomes through government engagement, not solely policy monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of European political structures, defense priorities, and government procurement processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate autonomously, set strategy, and execute in a fast‑paced, high‑growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, negotiation, and stakeholder‑management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THESE QUALIFICATIONS WOULD BE NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in space, aerospace, defense, or dual‑use technology sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with or within institutions such as DLR, MOD, Bundestag committees, EU defense bodies, or national innovation agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior roles in business development, defense industrial policy, or public‑sector consulting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Munich’s government, defense, or technology ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with NATO, EU defense initiatives, and cross‑border industrial‑cooperation frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;By applying for the above position, you will confirm that you have reviewed and agreed to our:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://rocketlabcorp.com/assets/Rocket-Lab-Germany-Candidate-Privacy-Policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Data Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WHAT TO EXPECT&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re on a mission to unlock the potential of space to improve life on Earth, but that’s not an easy task. It takes hard work, determination, relentless innovation, teamwork, grit, and an unwavering commitment to achieving what others often deem impossible. Our people out-think, out-work, and out-pace. We pride ourselves on having each other’s backs, checking our egos at the door, and rolling up our sleeves on all tasks big and small. We thrive under pressure, work to tight deadlines, and our focus is always on how we can deliver, rather than dwelling on the challenges that stand in the way.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Important information:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CANDIDATES SEEKING TO WORK IN US OFFICES ONLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To conform to U.S. Government space technology export regulations, including the International Traffic in Arms Regulations (ITAR), Rocket Lab Employees must be a U.S. citizen, lawful U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum, or be eligible to obtain the required authorizations from the U.S. Department of State and/or the U.S. Department of Commerce, as applicable. Learn more about ITAR &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.us/v2/url?u=https-3A__www.pmddtc.state.gov_-3Fid-3Dddtc-5Fkb-5Farticle-5Fpage-26sys-5Fid-3D24d528fddbfc930044f9ff621f961987&amp;amp;d=DwMFog&amp;amp;c=N_fLK0KxmM34zjMadXHMx_SQYmXWO3FX0MRVr1hBcn4&amp;amp;r=prjnch9sxomG2ahCicblmM3m-FuPObepspoR1qvWq2I&amp;amp;m=ExC44mBPk2emo4Fr0xPSGZN0UraQ1ZtkDTxwR7iWw5rixcFQb-Wjlv7lJcecLldz&amp;amp;s=0lfm4LyRtFwK220WHBK11DGHWSVvVhQEcfa5G_2Nf18&amp;amp;e=&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Rocket Lab provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws. This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment at Rocket Lab, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation, and training.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applicants requiring a reasonable accommodation for the application/interview process for a job in the United States should contact Giulia Johnson at &lt;a ---------- dedicated resource is intended solely to assist job seekers with disabilities whose disability prevents them from being able to apply/interview. Only messages left for this purpose will be considered. A response to your request may take up to two business days.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FOR CANDIDATES SEEKING TO WORK IN NEW ZEALAND OFFICES ONLY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For security reasons, background checks will be undertaken prior to any employment offers being made to an applicant.&amp;nbsp; These checks will include nationality checks as it is a requirement of this position that you be eligible to access equipment and data regulated by the United States&#39; International Traffic in Arms Regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Under these Regulations, you may be ineligible for this role if you do not hold citizenship of Australia, Japan, New Zealand, Switzerland, the European Union, or a country that is part of NATO, or if you hold ineligible dual citizenship or nationality.&amp;nbsp; For more information on these Regulations, click here &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link ___m14voj0 f3rmtva f1ern45e f1deefiw f1n71otn f1q5o8ev f1h8hb77 f1vxd6vx f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1hu3pq6 f11qmguv f19f4twv f1tyq0we f1g0x7ka fhxju0i f1qch9an f1cnd47f fqv5qza f1vmzxwi f1o700av f13mvf36 f9n3di6 f1ids18y fygtlnl f1deo86v f12x56k7 f1iescvh ftqa4ok f50u1b5 fs3pq8b f1hghxdh f1tymzes f1x7u7e9 f1cmlufx f10aw75t fsle3fq&quot; href=&quot;https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/2020/01/23/2020-00574/international-traffic-in-arms-regulations-us-munitions-list-categories-i-ii-and-iii&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;ITAR Regulations.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;From day one you’ll enable international coordination and implementation of strategic product priorities by creating, standardising and optimising processes across central and local physical product teams and other stakeholders. The role will require a mix of process improvement, change management, technical understanding, project management and stakeholder management skills. Not only will you be an ambassador of Product Operations Excellence, but also champion the value of process automation and optimization, to set a solid basis for growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the operating model:&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose end-to-end processes across central and local Product teams and adjacent functions (Procurement, FSQA, Production).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design and scale standards:&lt;/strong&gt; Own process frameworks, SOPs and rollout &quot;golden standards&quot; that teams across markets adopt. Challenge and iterate existing policies and guidelines when they no longer fit the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-market change:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive organizational change across markets and functions, balancing central consistency with local needs. Build alignment with senior stakeholders, resolve conflicts, and ensure a constant flow of information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead programs and automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Own complex automation and tooling initiatives from a commercial perspective. Sign off on tooling designs and business cases, guide Tech teams on scope, edge cases and interdependencies, and take part in Steering Committees. On top of that, identify where AI can reshape Product Operations processes, build the business cases and prototypes, and deploy the successful tools across markets and teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead under uncertainty:&lt;/strong&gt; Scope and drive short- and long-term programs from broadly defined outcomes. Develop plan Bs and alternative solutions when priorities shift, and turn ambiguous problems into manageable, measurable workstreams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years minimum experience in Product Operations or Operational/Process Excellence; passion for food or experience within Food/FMCG industry or consultancy is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognized expertise in process excellence, change management and program delivery, with advanced knowledge of methodologies, current best practices and industry trends. You continuously challenge the status quo and bring new ideas to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly numerate and commercially minded, able to build rigorous, objective business cases and to judge technical designs with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong stakeholder leader who manages global and local stakeholders at all levels, aligns teams across markets, and communicates clearly to different audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous and outcome-driven: you manage scope and timelines independently, prioritize relentlessly, and are comfortable being challenged on the soundness of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in a fast-paced, demanding and data-driven environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about AI and automation: you actively explore how AI can reshape processes, assess its impact rigorously, and lead teams to adopt it where it creates measurable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree from a top-tier university, preferably in business, management, operations or a related field. Six Sigma Belt or PMP certification is a big plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevate your lifestyle! Join one of Europe&#39;s fastest-growing tech powerhouses in a dynamic phase of expansion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 years contract.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in a diverse global community of 90+ nationalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy a competitive compensation package that goes beyond the norm, with perks like a HelloFresh- subsidized Pension Scheme, Berlin relocation support, and a Hybrid working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate your lifestyle with exclusive discounts on your weekly HelloFresh box and office meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Invest in your growth with an annual learning &amp;amp; development budget, German language learning budget, and access to the HelloFresh Academy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plus, we&#39;ve got your well-being covered with mental health support, transportation perks, and working-parent-friendly benefits. From our 24/7 gym access,wellbeing platforms like Headspace and Spill, to sabbatical leave options, HelloFresh is not just a workplace; it&#39;s a lifestyle of perks and possibilities!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;HelloFresh is on a mission to change the way people eat, forever!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Since our 2011 founding in Europe’s vibrant tech hub, Berlin, we’ve become the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider, delivering to over 4.2 million households worldwide in 15 countries across 3 continents.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our more than 15,000 employees from over 70+ nationalities are the heart and soul of our diverse, fast-paced and dynamic environment where innovation and smart, fast action is encouraged.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We will encourage you to make an immediate impact in your area of work as well as empower you to grow your career with us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you up for the challenge?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please submit your complete application below including your salary expectations and earliest starting date.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;After submitting an application our team will review this and get back to you within 5 business days.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are HelloFresh&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh we embrace and welcome diversity and we currently employ over 15,000 individuals globally who contribute to this. We employ individuals based on their ability to perform a job rather than on the basis of their: race, national origin, color, caste, social origin or position, gender, gender expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, disability, political opinion, marital status or any other characteristic. We encourage everyone to apply and will give everyone equal consideration. We are an equal opportunity employer – everyone is welcome at our table.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is committed to the principles of equal employment opportunity and providing reasonable accommodations to candidates with disabilities. If you need an accommodation during the application process, please reach out to us at:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Europe: ----- ----- States: ----- -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Welcome to Planet. We believe in using space to help life on Earth.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet designs, builds, and operates the largest constellation of imaging satellites in history. This constellation delivers an unprecedented dataset of empirical information via a revolutionary cloud-based platform to authoritative figures in commercial, environmental, and humanitarian sectors. We are both a space company and data company all rolled into one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customers and users across the globe use Planet&#39;s data to develop new technologies, drive revenue, power research, and solve our world’s toughest obstacles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we control every component of hardware design, manufacturing, data processing, and software engineering, our office is a truly inspiring mix of experts from a variety of domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a people-centric approach toward culture and community and we strive to iterate in a way that puts our team members first and prepares our company for growth. Join Planet and be a part of our mission to change the way people see the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Planet is a global company with employees working remotely world wide and joining us from offices in San Francisco, Washington DC, Germany, Austria, Slovenia, and The Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior PreSales Engineer, you&#39;ll demonstrate the value of Planet&#39;s data and services to help organizations across EMEA with a focus on German Government and Commercial B2B to overcome their earth data challenges. You&#39;ll also collaborate with internal cross-functional teams, including Customer Success, Product Management, Professional Services and Business Development, to act as the voice of the customer to enhance Planet&#39;s industry offerings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time, remote position based in Germany. If located near an office, you are expected to work from that office 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact You’ll Own:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use consultative techniques to uncover customers&#39; pain points and business needs within their current or intended processes and ways of working, plus quantify why these needs are important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deliver presentations and solution demonstrations highlighting technical capabilities of Planet’s platform related to addressing the customer’s business needs and pain points, plus the value that these solutions can bring to the customers business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create solid relationships with customers’ technical and management staff as a trusted advisor to their business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to customers, actively shaping and recommending tailored solutions architecture that solve key business challenges that bring measurable value to the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with your sales team colleagues to determine account development plans and execute a strategy to engage customers and prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal cross-functional teams including Customer Success, Product Management, Professional Services and Business Development to act as the voice of the customer and co-develop solutions .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with the response to tenders, RFI’s, RFP’s, proposals with respect to product/solution information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attain quarterly and annual sales and operational objectives assigned by management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with all Pre-Sales Engineers globally, building a community to improve the team’s technical and sales skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a mentor (in your specialist areas) to team members and lead training to drive their development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years experience in supporting governments and/or associated communities in earth observation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a relevant field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate technical and business related remote sensing and geospatial requirements and knowledge into smart, value-add solutions and demo architectures that address customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in German and professional working proficiency in English, the language of the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with QGIS, ArcGIS, GDAL and other common geospatial software packages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate and articulate complex customer requirements into simple easy to understand (co-created) value-add solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to successfully communicate and coordinate with international customers &amp;amp; sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and proactive working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to multitask, prioritize and manage time effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to program with Python to process imagery, manipulate vector data, interact with APIs and build data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead customer engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to run workshops or training sessions with users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to learn new technologies and industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You Stand Out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing technical proposals for (German) government tenders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of value / solution selling techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;11:45p / 23:45 CET on the date stated below. Applications are reviewed on a rolling basis. This posting may be removed earlier than projected if a suitable pool of applications has been received. For this reason, we recommend applying as soon as you are able to.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits While Working at Planet:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;These offerings are dependent on employment type and geographical location, based upon applicable law or company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off including vacation, holidays and company-wide days off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Wellness Program&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Phone and Internet Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement and access to LinkedIn Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Volunteering Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
