&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Build and improve portfolio monitoring frameworks, turning data into clear insights and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Monitor losses, delinquencies, inactivity, repayment trends and vintage performance to assess portfolio health and identify emerging risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Investigate changes in performance, explain their causes and identify opportunities to improve outcomes or support growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Use your analysis to inform credit risk strategies, including where customer eligibility could be expanded or tightened.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Develop forecasting models to better understand future risk and contribute to budgeting and planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Work with colleagues across risk and the first line to understand problems, communicate findings and recommend action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Deliver analytical projects across the portfolio, showing how your work contributes to business decisions rather than stopping at a report or dashboard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The interview process:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Screening call with Chess (Internal Recruiter) (30 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video interview with the Hiring Manager (1 hour)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Task based interview with the Risk Team (90 mins)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we think you&#39;ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Hands-on data analysis skills, including SQL or BigQuery experience, and the ability to apply those skills to unfamiliar tools. Our current analytics environment includes BigQuery and Looker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;The ability to move from data to an explanation: identifying patterns, investigating why they&#39;re happening and making practical recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Clear communication, including the ability to explain your own contribution to a project, your analytical approach and what changed as a result.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
