&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insurance and medical allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
